; Enter the debug room-warp mode (player state $FF)
;
; Reached only with the RAGE cheat on (#R$A422 has changed the JR at #R$AABE into JR Z) and the T key pressed: the
; player state becomes $FF, in which #R$AAAB runs the room warp #R$83CE instead of the player (observed with
; tests/inputs/cheat.txt: after T the direction keys step through the rooms 5, 6, 7, 12). Leaves the mode through
; #R$AD82.
; .
; Hardware: none.
@label=EnterRoomWarp
@isub=LD A,PLAYER_WARP
c$AAC0 LD A,$FF     ; debug room warp
 $AAC2 LD ($A894),A ;
 $AAC5 RET          ;
